      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, the one in sabiDepsMutator is actually needed!\nFor the sabiDepsMutator case, it\u0027s not guaranteed that the visited mudule is a cc_library, so the .sabi field could be nil, for example cc_object doesn\u0027t call cc/cc.go:newModule() in its factory method so its .sabi is nil.\nOn the other hand, (*libraryDecorator).compile() and (*libraryDecorator).linkSAbiDumpFiles() being a libraryDecorator* receiver implies that the module we\u0027re considering is a cc_library type, thus .sabi must be non-nil.",
